OL,3,GNEWSATwo storms in two days as Austen
OL,4,Aand Boelo target UK
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Met Office have named a new storm,
OL,7,FBoelo, which is set to bring another
OL,8,Fround of stormy weather to the UK over
OL,9,Fthe weekend.
OL,11,FStorm Boelo will be hot on the heels of
OL,12,FStorm Austen, the first named storm of
OL,13,Fthe season.
OL,15,FStorm Austen is expected to bring
OL,16,Fstrong winds to south-west England
OL,17,Fduring Friday morning.
OL,19,FThe Met Office has issued an amber wind
OL,20,Fwarning for Cornwall, the Isles of
OL,21,FScilly, Plymouth and parts of Devon
OL,22,Fvalid between 1am and 10am on Friday.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
